{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a realistic stock market simulator where every decision matters!<br>Manage your virtual company, trade a variety of stocks, and adapt to an ever-changing market influenced by real-time news events.<br>Find the best moments to buy or sell, balance risk and reward, and maximize your returns through smart asset management.<br>Unlock powerful financial tools including leverage, short selling, and ETFs to enhance your investment strategy.<br>Multiple difficulty levels are available, making the game accessible for beginners and challenging for experienced players alike.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, with strategic depth for advanced players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic news system affecting stock prices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable financial tools such as leverage, short selling, and ETFs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings for a customized investment experience</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882740?t=1768736458","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882740?t=1768736458","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882740/f11ecb474ad8cb41d386f86234cc8c4b28855301/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768736458","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882740/f11ecb474ad8cb41d386f86234cc8c4b28855301/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768736458","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a realistic stock market simulator where every dec